# Icons: reicon-react only

This project uses **`reicon-react` as the only icon library**.

## Never do

- Do not import from Lucide, Tabler, Phosphor, Remix, Hugeicons, Radix Icons, react-icons, Heroicons, Feather, or any other icon package.
- Do not add those packages to `package.json` / lockfile.
- Do not set `components.json` `iconLibrary` to anything that would pull a non-reicon icon package into app code.

## Always do

- Import icons from `reicon-react` (e.g. `import { Home, Check } from "reicon-react"`).
- After `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add …`, if generated UI code imports another icon library:
  1. Replace those imports/usages with `reicon-react` equivalents.
  2. Remove the unwanted icon dependency if the CLI installed it.
- Keep Biome `noRestrictedImports` bans intact; do not weaken them to allow other icon libs.
